---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="About">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">About this project</h1>
  <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-stone-700">
    <p>
      Collective agreements govern the working lives of hundreds of millions of people, yet their
      contents are scattered across thousands of registries, union sites and employer portals,
      usually buried in long legal PDFs.
    </p>
    <p>
      This project makes them legible. Anyone can submit an agreement from any country. An AI
      model produces a structured summary — parties, term, wages, hours, leave, grievance
      procedures — which is published immediately and clearly labelled as machine-generated.
      The community then verifies and corrects it, with full version history, Wikipedia-style.
    </p>
    <p><strong>AI content is always labelled and never presented as authoritative.</strong></p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold">Not legal advice</h2>
    <p>
      Summaries may be wrong or outdated. For anything that matters, read the original document
      linked on every page and consult a qualified adviser.
    </p>
    <h2 class="pt-4 text-xl font-semibold">Takedowns</h2>
    <p>
      If you hold rights to an agreement hosted here, contact us and we will remove it
      promptly.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
